'>\r\n  <TD width='149' height='23' align='CENTER'>증 감&nbsp;</TD>\r\n  <TD width='169' height='23' align='RIGHT' style='font-size:10pt;'>-167,233,222,822&nbsp;</TD>\r\n  <TD width='168' height='23' align='RIGHT' style='font-size:10pt;'>-280,446,640,731&nbsp;</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR height='30'>\r\n  <TD width='78' height='83' rowspan='3' align='CENTER'>순자산</TD>\r\n  <TD width='149' height='23' align='CENTER'>기초 순자산&nbsp;</TD>\r\n  <TD width='169' height='23' align='RIGHT' style='font-size:10pt;'>478,635,524,253&nbsp;</TD>\r\n  <TD width='168' height='23'>　</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR height='30'>\r\n  <TD width='149' height='23' align='CENTER'>기말 순자산&nbsp;</TD>\r\n  <TD width='169' height='23' align='RIGHT' style='font-size:10pt;'>281,946,056,946&nbsp;</TD>\r\n  <TD width='168' height='23'>　</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR height='30'>\r\n  <TD width='149' height='23' align='CENTER'>증 감&nbsp;</TD>\r\n  <TD width='169' height='23' align='RIGHT' style='font-size:10pt;'>-196,689,467,307&nbsp;</TD>\r\n  <TD width='168' height='23'>　</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n</TBODY>\r\n</TABLE>\r\n<P style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"굴림\", Gulim;'>대상기간: 2025.09.18 ~ 2026.09.17(재투자금액 0원 제외)<BR/><BR/></P>\r\n<P style='font-weight:bold;padding-left:16px;'>나. 집합투자증권 발행 비용</P>\r\n<TABLE border='1' width='600'>\r\n<COLGROUP>\r\n<COL width='200'></COL>\r\n<COL width='200'></COL>\r\n<COL width='200'></COL>\r\n</COLGROUP>\r\n<TBODY>\r\n<TR height='30'>\r\n  <TD width='191' height='23' align='CENTER' style='font-weight:bold;'>발행 비용 구분&nbsp;</TD>\r\n  <TD width='191' height='23' align='CENTER' style='font-weight:bold;'>금액(원)</TD>\r\n  <TD width='191' height='23' align='CENTER' style='font-weight:bold;'>비고</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR height='31'>\r\n  <TD width='191' height='24' align='CENTER'>발행분담금</TD>\r\n  <TD width='191' height='24' align='CENTER' style='font-size:10pt;'>0&nbsp;</TD>\r\n  <TD width='191' height='24' align='CENTER' style='font-size:12pt;'><BR/></TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR height='31'>\r\n  <TD width='191' height='24' align='CENTER'>기타비용</TD>\r\n  <TD width='191' height='24' align='CENTER' style='font-size:10pt;'>338,815,570</TD>\r\n  <TD width='191' height='24' align='CENTER' style='font-size:12pt;'><BR/></TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR height='31'>\r\n  <TD width='191' height='24' align='CENTER'>총 계</TD>\r\n  <TD width='191' height='24' align='CENTER' style='font-size:10pt;'>338,815,570</TD>\r\n  <TD width='191' height='24' align='CENTER' style='font-size:12pt;'><BR/></TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n</TBODY>\r\n</TABLE>\r\n<P style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"굴림\", Gulim;font-size:11pt;'>주1) 기타비용은 채권평가보수, 펀드평가보수, 펀드결제수수료, 지수사용료, 기타위탁보수(위원회보수, 보관대리인보수, 지급대리인보수, 후원기금), 기타비용(기타비용, 청산비용, 감독이사보수, 해외거래예탁비용 등), 기타보험관련보수, 부동산감정평가수수료, 부동산법률자문수수료를 포함합니다. 단, 모자형의 경우 모투자신탁의 기타비용을 제외하며, 종류형의 경우 각 종류 수익증권에서 발생하는 기타비용은 제외합니다. <BR/>주2) 발행분담금이 2,000원 미만인 경우에는 납부하지 않으며, 10원 미만은 절사합니다.<BR/><BR/></P>\r\n<P><BR/></P>\r\n</BODY>\r\n</HTML>"], ["4.청약,배정및인수에관한사항", "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/loose.dtd\">\r\n<HTML style='border:0'>\r\n<HEAD>\r\n<TITLE></TITLE>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"ie=edge\" >\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-TextLayoutMetrics\" content=\"gdi\" >\r\n<META http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\r\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/css/report_xml.css\">\r\n</HEAD>\r\n<BODY bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\r\n<P><BR/></P>\r\n<P class='section-2'><A name='toc1'>4. 청약, 배정 및 인수에 관한 사항</A></P>\r\n<P style='font-family:DartNBSP, \"굴림\", Gulim;font-size:11pt;'>- 해당사항 없음.<BR/><BR/></P>\r\n<P><BR/></P>\r\n</BODY>\r\n</HTML>"], ["5.상장및증자등기에관한사항", "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/loose.dtd\">\r\n<HTML style='border:0'>\r\n<HEAD>\r\n<TITLE></TITLE>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"ie=edge\" >\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-TextLayoutMetrics\" content=\"gdi\" >\r\n<META http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\r\n<lin